#ASSERT `Under regulation 74B(1), does the FCA's power to require a skilled person's report apply to my business` TRUE `estate agent` EQUALS JUST FALSE -- outside the kinds the regulation names: "This regulation applies where" (ruled 2026-11-05 (b); was NOTHING)

#ASSERT `Under regulation 74B(2), may the FCA require me to give it a report by a skilled person` `reg 65-110 Yes` TRUE `reg 74B(2)(a) require the relevant person by notice in writing to appoint a skilled person to provide the FCA with a report on the matter concerned` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under regulation 74B(2), may the FCA require me to give it a report by a skilled person` `reg 65-110 Yes` FALSE `reg 74B(2)(a) require the relevant person by notice in writing to appoint a skilled person to provide the FCA with a report on the matter concerned` EQUALS NOTHING -- not by notice in writing
#ASSERT `Under regulation 74B(2), may the FCA require me to give it a report by a skilled person` `reg 65-110 Yes` FALSE `reg 74B(2)(b) itself appoint a skilled person to provide the FCA with a report on the matter concerned` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- the FCA itself appoints the skilled person
#ASSERT `Under regulation 74B(2), may the FCA require me to give it a report by a skilled person` `reg 65-110 No` TRUE `reg 74B(2)(b) itself appoint a skilled person to provide the FCA with a report on the matter concerned` EQUALS JUST FALSE -- regulation 74B(1) does not apply: "This regulation applies where" (ruled 2026-11-05 (b); was NOTHING)

#ASSERT `Under regulation 74B(6), did I give the skilled person the assistance required` TRUE `reg 65-110 I am not sure` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under regulation 74B(6), did I give the skilled person the assistance required` TRUE `reg 65-110 I am not sure` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- the relevant person did not assist
#ASSERT `Under regulation 74B(6), did I give the skilled person the assistance required` FALSE `reg 65-110 No` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- neither the relevant person nor a connected person

