#ASSERT `Under regulation 74C(1), may the FCA impose a direction on my cryptoasset business` FALSE TRUE `cryptoasset exchange provider` EQUALS NOTHING -- not in writing
#ASSERT `Under regulation 74C(1), may the FCA impose a direction on my cryptoasset business` TRUE TRUE `estate agent` EQUALS NOTHING -- an estate agent is not a cryptoasset business

