#ASSERT `Under regulation 74C(10), does the FCA notice of a direction contain what it must` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- no statement of the right to refer to the Upper Tribunal
#ASSERT `Under regulation 74C(10), does the FCA notice of a direction contain what it must` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- not the notice in paragraph (9)

§§ `Penalties, measures, prohibitions and prosecution (regulations 75 to 92)`

#ASSERT `Under regulation 75, is the requirement I contravened a relevant requirement` `reg 65-110 Yes` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- Schedule 6 lists it
#ASSERT `Under regulation 75, is the requirement I contravened a relevant requirement` `reg 65-110 No` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under regulation 75, is the requirement I contravened a relevant requirement` `reg 65-110 I am not sure` EQUALS NOTHING -- Schedule 6 has not answered

-- 76(1).  Inputs: a designated supervisory authority; satisfied that I contravened; a relevant requirement.
