#ASSERT `Under regulation 76(2), may a designated supervisory authority impose a penalty on me or publish a statement about me` `reg 65-110 No` `reg 76(2)(a) impose a penalty of such amount as it considers appropriate on P` EQUALS JUST FALSE -- "Paragraph (2) applies if" and it does not (marginal reading (a); was NOTHING)

