#ASSERT `Under regulation 76(3), may the authority impose a penalty on me as an officer of the business` `reg 65-110 Yes` `reg 65-110 No` TRUE `reg 65-110 Yes` EQUALS JUST FALSE -- not an officer of the entity at all (marginal reading (a); was NOTHING)

