#ASSERT `Under regulation 76(6), did the authority consider whether I followed the guidance` TRUE `reg 65-110 No` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- not that kind of guidance
#ASSERT `Under regulation 76(6), did the authority consider whether I followed the guidance` FALSE `reg 65-110 Yes` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- not deciding whether I contravened

