#ASSERT `Under regulation 76(7), to whom is a penalty imposed on me payable` TRUE `reg 65-110 the Commissioners for Her Majesty's Revenue and Customs` `Law Society` EQUALS JUST `the Commissioners for Her Majesty's Revenue and Customs`
#ASSERT `Under regulation 76(7), to whom is a penalty imposed on me payable` TRUE `reg 65-110 the Treasury` `Law Society` EQUALS NOTHING -- not a designated supervisory authority
