-- Under schedule 3A paragraph 14, is the trust an excluded trust because it is a commercial transactions trust
-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 14, is the trust an excluded trust because it is a commercial transactions trust` WITH `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating a transaction effected for genuine commercial reasons` IS TRUE, `the trust was created for the purpose of protecting or enforcing rights relating to such a transaction` IS FALSE, `the use of the trust is incidental to the principal purpose of the transaction` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (b) protecting or enforcing rights relating to such a transaction
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 14, is the trust an excluded trust because it is a commercial transactions trust` WITH `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating a transaction effected for genuine commercial reasons` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purpose of protecting or enforcing rights relating to such a transaction` IS TRUE, `the use of the trust is incidental to the principal purpose of the transaction` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- neither (a) nor (b)
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 14, is the trust an excluded trust because it is a commercial transactions trust` WITH `the trust was created for the purpose of enabling or facilitating a transaction effected for genuine commercial reasons` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purpose of protecting or enforcing rights relating to such a transaction` IS FALSE, `the use of the trust is incidental to the principal purpose of the transaction` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Under schedule 3A paragraph 15, is the trust an excluded trust because it holds legal title to an asset until a transfer is completed
-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 15, is the trust an excluded trust because it holds legal title to an asset until a transfer is completed` WITH `the trust was created on the transfer or disposal of an asset` IS TRUE, `the purpose of the trust is to hold the legal title to the asset on trust for the person to whom the transfer or disposal is being made until the procedure required by law to effect the transfer or disposal of legal title is completed` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- another purpose: the "where" is not met
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 15, is the trust an excluded trust because it holds legal title to an asset until a transfer is completed` WITH `the trust was created on the transfer or disposal of an asset` IS TRUE, `the purpose of the trust is to hold the legal title to the asset on trust for the person to whom the transfer or disposal is being made until the procedure required by law to effect the transfer or disposal of legal title is completed` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not created on a transfer or disposal
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 15, is the trust an excluded trust because it holds legal title to an asset until a transfer is completed` WITH `the trust was created on the transfer or disposal of an asset` IS FALSE, `the purpose of the trust is to hold the legal title to the asset on trust for the person to whom the transfer or disposal is being made until the procedure required by law to effect the transfer or disposal of legal title is completed` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Under schedule 3A paragraph 16, is the trust an excluded trust because it holds property to which section 71A or 71D of the Inheritance Tax Act 1984 applies
-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 16, is the trust an excluded trust because it holds property to which section 71A or 71D of the Inheritance Tax Act 1984 applies` WITH `the trust holds property to which section 71A or 71D of the Inheritance Tax Act 1984 applies` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the description is not met
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 16, is the trust an excluded trust because it holds property to which section 71A or 71D of the Inheritance Tax Act 1984 applies` WITH `the trust holds property to which section 71A or 71D of the Inheritance Tax Act 1984 applies` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Under schedule 3A paragraph 16+1 (the first unnumbered paragraph after paragraph 16), is the trust an excluded trust because a direction under paragraph 1 of Schedule 4 to the Inheritance Tax Act 1984 has effect
-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 16+1 (the first unnumbered paragraph after paragraph 16), is the trust an excluded trust because a direction under paragraph 1 of Schedule 4 to the Inheritance Tax Act 1984 has effect` WITH `the trust is of property in respect of which a direction under paragraph 1 of Schedule 4 to the Inheritance Tax Act 1984 has effect` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the description is not met
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 16+1 (the first unnumbered paragraph after paragraph 16), is the trust an excluded trust because a direction under paragraph 1 of Schedule 4 to the Inheritance Tax Act 1984 has effect` WITH `the trust is of property in respect of which a direction under paragraph 1 of Schedule 4 to the Inheritance Tax Act 1984 has effect` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Under schedule 3A paragraph 16+2 (the second unnumbered paragraph after paragraph 16), is the trust an excluded trust because it holds funds from a personal injury payment disregarded from capital
-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 16+2 (the second unnumbered paragraph after paragraph 16), is the trust an excluded trust because it holds funds from a personal injury payment disregarded from capital` WITH `the trust is of funds derived from a payment` IS TRUE, `the payment was made for the benefit of a person in consequence of a personal injury to that person` IS TRUE, `the payment was disregarded from capital under regulation 46(2) of, and paragraph 12 of Schedule 10 to, the Income Support (General) Regulations 1987` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (a) not made in consequence of a personal injury
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 16+2 (the second unnumbered paragraph after paragraph 16), is the trust an excluded trust because it holds funds from a personal injury payment disregarded from capital` WITH `the trust is of funds derived from a payment` IS TRUE, `the payment was made for the benefit of a person in consequence of a personal injury to that person` IS FALSE, `the payment was disregarded from capital under regulation 46(2) of, and paragraph 12 of Schedule 10 to, the Income Support (General) Regulations 1987` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (b) not disregarded from capital
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 16+2 (the second unnumbered paragraph after paragraph 16), is the trust an excluded trust because it holds funds from a personal injury payment disregarded from capital` WITH `the trust is of funds derived from a payment` IS TRUE, `the payment was made for the benefit of a person in consequence of a personal injury to that person` IS TRUE, `the payment was disregarded from capital under regulation 46(2) of, and paragraph 12 of Schedule 10 to, the Income Support (General) Regulations 1987` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Under schedule 3A paragraph 16+3 (the third unnumbered paragraph after paragraph 16), is the trust an excluded trust because it holds tenants' contributions under section 42 of the Landlord and Tenant Act 1987
-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 16+3 (the third unnumbered paragraph after paragraph 16), is the trust an excluded trust because it holds tenants' contributions under section 42 of the Landlord and Tenant Act 1987` WITH `the trust holds tenants' contributions for the purposes of section 42 of the Landlord and Tenant Act 1987` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the description is not met
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 16+3 (the third unnumbered paragraph after paragraph 16), is the trust an excluded trust because it holds tenants' contributions under section 42 of the Landlord and Tenant Act 1987` WITH `the trust holds tenants' contributions for the purposes of section 42 of the Landlord and Tenant Act 1987` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Under schedule 3A paragraph 16+4 (the fourth unnumbered paragraph after paragraph 16), is the trust an excluded trust because it is the plan trust of a qualifying share incentive plan
-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 16+4 (the fourth unnumbered paragraph after paragraph 16), is the trust an excluded trust because it is the plan trust of a qualifying share incentive plan` WITH `the trust is the plan trust of a share incentive plan` IS TRUE, `the share incentive plan meets the requirements of Part 9 of Schedule 2 to the Income Tax (Earnings and Pensions) Act 2003` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the plan does not meet the requirements
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 16+4 (the fourth unnumbered paragraph after paragraph 16), is the trust an excluded trust because it is the plan trust of a qualifying share incentive plan` WITH `the trust is the plan trust of a share incentive plan` IS TRUE, `the share incentive plan meets the requirements of Part 9 of Schedule 2 to the Income Tax (Earnings and Pensions) Act 2003` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- not the plan trust of a share incentive plan
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 16+4 (the fourth unnumbered paragraph after paragraph 16), is the trust an excluded trust because it is the plan trust of a qualifying share incentive plan` WITH `the trust is the plan trust of a share incentive plan` IS FALSE, `the share incentive plan meets the requirements of Part 9 of Schedule 2 to the Income Tax (Earnings and Pensions) Act 2003` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Under schedule 3A paragraph 16+5 (the fifth unnumbered paragraph after paragraph 16), is the trust an excluded trust because it was created under a qualifying share option scheme
-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 16+5 (the fifth unnumbered paragraph after paragraph 16), is the trust an excluded trust because it was created under a qualifying share option scheme` WITH `the trust was created under a share option scheme` IS TRUE, `the share option scheme meets the requirements of Parts 2 to 7 of Schedule 3 to the Income Tax (Earnings and Pensions) Act 2003` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the scheme does not meet the requirements
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 16+5 (the fifth unnumbered paragraph after paragraph 16), is the trust an excluded trust because it was created under a qualifying share option scheme` WITH `the trust was created under a share option scheme` IS TRUE, `the share option scheme meets the requirements of Parts 2 to 7 of Schedule 3 to the Income Tax (Earnings and Pensions) Act 2003` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- not created under a share option scheme
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 16+5 (the fifth unnumbered paragraph after paragraph 16), is the trust an excluded trust because it was created under a qualifying share option scheme` WITH `the trust was created under a share option scheme` IS FALSE, `the share option scheme meets the requirements of Parts 2 to 7 of Schedule 3 to the Income Tax (Earnings and Pensions) Act 2003` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Under schedule 3A paragraph 16+6 (the sixth unnumbered paragraph after paragraph 16), is the trust an excluded trust because it holds property for a disabled person
-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 16+6 (the sixth unnumbered paragraph after paragraph 16), is the trust an excluded trust because it holds property for a disabled person` WITH `the trust holds property for a beneficiary who is a disabled person within the meaning given by Schedule 1A to the Finance Act 2005` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the description is not met
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 16+6 (the sixth unnumbered paragraph after paragraph 16), is the trust an excluded trust because it holds property for a disabled person` WITH `the trust holds property for a beneficiary who is a disabled person within the meaning given by Schedule 1A to the Finance Act 2005` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Under schedule 3A paragraph 23, is the trust an excluded trust because it was created to enable or assist a public authority to carry out its functions
-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 23, is the trust an excluded trust because it was created to enable or assist a public authority to carry out its functions` WITH `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting a public authority within the meaning of section 3(1) of the Freedom of Information Act 2000 or a body specified in section 80(2) of that Act` IS TRUE, `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting a Scottish public authority within the meaning of section 3(1) of the Freedom of Information (Scotland) Act 2002` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting the Security Service, the Secret Intelligence Service, the Government Communications Headquarters or the National Crime Agency` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting the Welsh Assembly Government` IS FALSE, `the purpose is to carry out its functions` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (b) a Scottish public authority
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 23, is the trust an excluded trust because it was created to enable or assist a public authority to carry out its functions` WITH `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting a public authority within the meaning of section 3(1) of the Freedom of Information Act 2000 or a body specified in section 80(2) of that Act` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting a Scottish public authority within the meaning of section 3(1) of the Freedom of Information (Scotland) Act 2002` IS TRUE, `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting the Security Service, the Secret Intelligence Service, the Government Communications Headquarters or the National Crime Agency` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting the Welsh Assembly Government` IS FALSE, `the purpose is to carry out its functions` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (c) the Security Service, SIS, GCHQ or the NCA
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 23, is the trust an excluded trust because it was created to enable or assist a public authority to carry out its functions` WITH `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting a public authority within the meaning of section 3(1) of the Freedom of Information Act 2000 or a body specified in section 80(2) of that Act` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting a Scottish public authority within the meaning of section 3(1) of the Freedom of Information (Scotland) Act 2002` IS FALSE, `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting the Security Service, the Secret Intelligence Service, the Government Communications Headquarters or the National Crime Agency` IS TRUE, `the trust was created for the purposes of enabling or assisting the Welsh Assembly Government` IS FALSE, `the purpose is to carry out its functions` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Under schedule 3A paragraph 23A(3), is the kind of asset an asset of appreciable worth
-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 23A(3), is the kind of asset an asset of appreciable worth` WITH `the kind of asset` IS `sch 3A a work of art`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- an antique
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 23A(3), is the kind of asset an asset of appreciable worth` WITH `the kind of asset` IS `sch 3A an antique`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a collectible
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 23A(3), is the kind of asset an asset of appreciable worth` WITH `the kind of asset` IS `sch 3A a collectible`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Under schedule 3A paragraph 23A, is the trust an excluded trust under the general exclusion
-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 23A, is the trust an excluded trust under the general exclusion` WITH `the trust holds an interest in land in the United Kingdom` IS FALSE, `the total value of the assets of appreciable worth that the trust holds` IS 2000, `the cumulative total value of the property the trust has held since it was created` IS 10000, `the income of the trust per annum` IS 5000, `the trust is a UK trust which is an express trust` IS FALSE, `the settlor has, during his or her lifetime, created one or more other UK trusts which are express trusts` IS FALSE, `one of the trusts mentioned in paragraph 23A(2)(a) is or was an excluded trust under paragraph 23A` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (1)(a) the trust holds an interest in land in the United Kingdom
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 23A, is the trust an excluded trust under the general exclusion` WITH `the trust holds an interest in land in the United Kingdom` IS TRUE, `the total value of the assets of appreciable worth that the trust holds` IS 2000, `the cumulative total value of the property the trust has held since it was created` IS 10000, `the income of the trust per annum` IS 5000, `the trust is a UK trust which is an express trust` IS FALSE, `the settlor has, during his or her lifetime, created one or more other UK trusts which are express trusts` IS FALSE, `one of the trusts mentioned in paragraph 23A(2)(a) is or was an excluded trust under paragraph 23A` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (1)(b) assets of appreciable worth of exactly 2,000: 'not exceeding'
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 23A, is the trust an excluded trust under the general exclusion` WITH `the trust holds an interest in land in the United Kingdom` IS FALSE, `the total value of the assets of appreciable worth that the trust holds` IS 2000, `the cumulative total value of the property the trust has held since it was created` IS 10000, `the income of the trust per annum` IS 5000, `the trust is a UK trust which is an express trust` IS FALSE, `the settlor has, during his or her lifetime, created one or more other UK trusts which are express trusts` IS FALSE, `one of the trusts mentioned in paragraph 23A(2)(a) is or was an excluded trust under paragraph 23A` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Under schedule 3A paragraph 24, is the person a relevant supervised person
-- the case that satisfies the paragraph
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 24, is the person a relevant supervised person` WITH `the person is a relevant person` IS `mlr5 yes`, `the person is subject to requirements in national legislation having an equivalent effect to those laid down in the fourth money laundering directive on an obliged entity` IS FALSE, `the person is supervised for compliance with those requirements in a manner equivalent to section 2 of Chapter VI of the fourth money laundering directive` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (a) a relevant person
#ASSERT (`Under schedule 3A paragraph 24, is the person a relevant supervised person` WITH `the person is a relevant person` IS `mlr5 yes`, `the person is subject to requirements in national legislation having an equivalent effect to those laid down in the fourth money laundering directive on an obliged entity` IS FALSE, `the person is supervised for compliance with those requirements in a manner equivalent to section 2 of Chapter VI of the fourth money laundering directive` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (b) not a relevant person but subject to and supervised under equivalent requirements
